message: "If you use verified-reserving, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "verified-reserving: machine-checked claims reserving in Lean 4"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: 2026-08-25
authors:
  - family-names: Sneiderman
    given-names: Robert
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-4519-2846"
url: "https://github.com/Robby955/verified-reserving"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Robby955/verified-reserving"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - actuarial science
  - chain ladder
  - claims reserving
  - formal verification
  - Lean 4
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of claims-reserving and actuarial risk results,
  including Mack chain ladder, Munich chain ladder, stochastic ODP,
  claims development results, Bornhuetter-Ferguson, Buhlmann-Straub, and
  Panjer recursion. The library separates exact results from estimators,
  approximations, and conventions, and includes an explicit proof-dependency
  audit of 479 named declarations.
